emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">快手旗下可灵AI将完成30亿美元融资并计划12个月内启动赴港IPO</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta正式建立云业务并转售闲置AI算力，股价盘中大涨10%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI云平台Together AI完成8亿美元C轮融资，估值达83亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌大幅扩容Gemini API免费额度，Gemini 2.5 Flash系列TPM提升至百万级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日正式上调Gemini API免费层级配额，Gemini 2.5 Flash及Flash-Lite模型在部分账户中的单分钟Token处理上限（TPM）已提升至100万。此次扩容延续了免绑卡、不限总量的低门槛策略，旨在降低个人开发者与初创团队的试错成本。尽管TPM大幅放宽，但各模型的请求频率限制（RPM）仍维持在每分钟15至30次，每日请求总量（RPD）锁定为1500次，且Pro版本模型暂未纳入免费队列。谷歌明确指出，免费层级下的Prompt与反馈内容可能被用于模型训练，开发者需评估业务数据敏感度。行业分析认为，谷歌此举意在通过极致性价比吸引开发者迁入其API生态，以应对开源模型在推理服务市场的竞争压力。开发者可通过官方页面查询账户具体额度，并根据需求决定是否升级至付费版本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝AI生活助理“阿宝”正式开启全量公测，上线72项生活办事技能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8d9d652bef366d08d46ac221e5968c0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月2日，支付宝AI生活助理“阿宝”正式面向全量用户开启公测，iOS与安卓用户无需邀请码，通过应用商店或App内搜索即可直接体验。该应用在经历一个月内测后，重点强化了生活服务垂域模型能力，并在政务、缴费、文旅等十余类板块中上线72项高频刚需技能。用户可通过自然语言对话，实现跨页面、跨应用的复杂操作，如多条件旅游规划及对话式电商购物。此外，新版本引入亲密度陪伴体系，支持勋章解锁、对话装扮及闲聊、解压建议等个性化人格化互动。支付宝表示，公测版发布后，用户可在原版本与全新AI版之间自由切换。此次公测标志着支付宝AI应用正式进入大规模场景实践阶段，通过将AI能力深度嵌入生活服务生态，旨在提升用户办理高频业务的交互效率与体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手旗下可灵AI将完成30亿美元融资并计划12个月内启动赴港IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e9c34d14dd68da03d0c7401b404d5c79.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">快手旗下文生视频模型可灵AI即将完成30亿美元融资，腾讯参与本轮投资，投后估值达180亿美元。公司计划在未来12个月内正式启动赴港IPO流程，募集资金将重点投入算力与数据中心扩建、核心人才引进及激励。财务数据显示，可灵AI商业化进展迅速，2026年第一季度营收突破6.5亿元人民币，同比增幅超300%，截至3月年化收入运行率（ARR）已接近5亿美元。尽管此前曾传出200亿美元估值目标，此次180亿美元的估值反映了当前大模型一级市场的理性回归。通过分拆引入外部资本并冲刺上市，可灵AI旨在缓解高昂的算力成本压力，进一步巩固其在生成式AI领域的头部地位，并加速行业梯队分化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta正式建立云业务并转售闲置AI算力，股价盘中大涨10%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0dd2f9343c818630e26c716e892d3116.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式宣布建立云业务，通过转售其闲置的AI计算资源及开放AI模型访问权限，开辟全新的B端变现路径。作为英伟达GPU的全球最大买家之一，Meta今年在AI基础设施上的投入预计高达1450亿美元。尽管此前已推出由Alexandr Wang领导研发的大模型Muse Spark，但内部需求仍无法完全消耗其庞大的硬件储备。此次战略调整效仿了SpaceX的商业模式，即通过出租闲置GPU算力来优化资产利用率并缓解高额资本开支压力。受此消息提振，Meta股价盘中上涨约10%。这一举措标志着科技巨头在AI军备竞赛中正从单纯的硬件投入转向算力资产运营，随着头部企业纷纷入局，传统云计算市场格局或将迎来新一轮重塑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI云平台Together AI完成8亿美元C轮融资，估值达83亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/167727c29f8a8a9156fba8a89a64dcfd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI基础设施及云服务平台Together AI今日宣布完成8亿美元C轮融资，公司估值达到83亿美元。本轮融资由沙特阿美创投领投，英伟达、Vista Equity Partners、General Catalyst等机构参投。Together AI成立于2022年，主营英伟达GPU集群租赁等“Neocloud”技术服务。得益于企业对高性能、低成本开源模型需求的激增，该公司上一季度年度预订额已突破11.5亿美元，拥有Cursor、Cognition等数千家付费客户。此次融资距离B轮仅过去16个月，资金将用于进一步扩大算力基础设施规模。随着开源模型使用量在过去一年增长两倍，企业正加速转向具备成本优势的开源生态，Together AI的融资进展显示出算力主导权正向新型云服务商倾斜。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
